# CP Corporal: docs/Walkthrough.md section 1 on the wire, replayed by
#   scenarios/corporal_walkthrough.cpp   in process (InMemoryMockBroker, injected time)
#   scenarios/corporal_broker.py         over a real mosquitto (tools/codeline_office.py)
# Grammar: src/codeline/testing/WireScript.h. A topic is <channel>/<rest>: appliances, codeline
# or simulation, each read from the station file's `channel` records.
#
#   expect    a message the Walkthrough shows, with the Walkthrough's own string
#             (or, for the lock, MQTT.md section 5a's, which the Walkthrough points to)
#   extra     a message observed that the Walkthrough does not show
#   differs   a message observed where the Walkthrough shows something else: both strings
#
# The Walkthrough writes appliance topics without {channel} (/turnout/Corporal:829/cmd); here they
# carry it (appliances/turnout/Corporal:829/cmd = {appliances channel}/turnout/Corporal:829/cmd).
#
# Every appliance command and every indication frame is checked after `begin`, named here or not:
# an unscripted one fails the run.

# Switch 829 is found reversed at power-on, so the move has to throw it (Walkthrough step 3).
initial turnout/Corporal:829 REVERSE

step boot: every appliance reports; the startup time locking of the routes whose approach is outside Corporal expires
await codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 (829NWK) 829RWK (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
begin

step 2. checks OS occupancy, locks and opposing signals
retained appliances/sensor/Corporal:829T1/state (ACTIVE)
retained appliances/sensor/Corporal:827T1/state (ACTIVE)
retained appliances/control/Corporal:lock:827/state (SW1)
retained appliances/turnout/Corporal:827D/state NORMAL (REVERSE)
retained appliances/signalmast/Corporal:830EAB/state STOP
retained appliances/signalmast/Corporal:828EA/state STOP

step 1. press CODE
send codeline/Corporal/controls CHART 85973c19 829NWS (829RWS) (827WLS) 828WGS (828EGS) (828HS) 830WGS (830EGS) (830HS) (1MCS)
expect codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 (829NWK) (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
step 3. commands power switch 829
expect appliances/turnout/Corporal:829/cmd NORMAL (REVERSE)
step 4. points unlock and begin moving
expect appliances/turnout/Corporal:829/state (NORMAL) (REVERSE)
step 5. points lock in correspondence
expect appliances/turnout/Corporal:829/state NORMAL (REVERSE)
step 6. route solves to APPROACH (next signal at Christopher is STOP)
expect appliances/signalmast/Corporal:830WAB/cmd APPROACH
expect codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
step 7. mast confirms APPROACH
expect appliances/signalmast/Corporal:830WAB/state APPROACH
expect codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) 828WGK (828EGK) (828TEK) 830WGK (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)

step train approaching: the freight occupies 832T, in rear of 830WAB
send simulation/sensor/Corporal:832T SHUNT
expect appliances/sensor/Corporal:832T/state ACTIVE

step cancel: the dispatcher centers lever 830 (830HS) and presses CODE
send codeline/Corporal/controls CHART 85973c19 829NWS (829RWS) (827WLS) 828WGS (828EGS) (828HS) (830WGS) (830EGS) 830HS (1MCS)
# The Walkthrough describes this republish ("still showing 828WGK / 830WGK until the mast
# leaves proceed") without spelling the frame; this is that frame.
expect codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) 828WGK (828EGK) (828TEK) 830WGK (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
expect appliances/signalmast/Corporal:830WAB/cmd STOP
expect appliances/signalmast/Corporal:830WAB/state STOP
expect codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) 830TEK (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
mark TER

step time locking keeps 829WLR down: a reverse demand for 829 is ignored
send codeline/Corporal/controls CHART 85973c19 (829NWS) 829RWS (827WLS) (828WGS) (828EGS) (828HS) (830WGS) (830EGS) 830HS (1MCS)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) 830TEK (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
quiet 1000

step the timer expires
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
elapsed TER

step train passing: the dispatcher clears 830WAB again for the waiting freight
send codeline/Corporal/controls CHART 85973c19 829NWS (829RWS) (827WLS) 828WGS (828EGS) (828HS) 830WGS (830EGS) (830HS) (1MCS)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
expect appliances/signalmast/Corporal:830WAB/cmd APPROACH
expect appliances/signalmast/Corporal:830WAB/state APPROACH
expect codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) 828WGK (828EGK) (828TEK) 830WGK (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)

step train passing: the freight accepts 830WAB and enters the OS 829T1
send simulation/sensor/Corporal:829T1 SHUNT
extra appliances/sensor/Corporal:829T1/state ACTIVE
extra appliances/signalmast/Corporal:830WAB/cmd STOP
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) 828WGK (828EGK) (828TEK) 830WGK (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) 829T1K
extra appliances/signalmast/Corporal:830WAB/state STOP
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) 829T1K

step train passing: the head end enters 827T1, the rear clears 832T
send simulation/sensor/Corporal:827T1 SHUNT
extra appliances/sensor/Corporal:827T1/state ACTIVE
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) 827T1K 829T1K
send simulation/sensor/Corporal:832T (SHUNT)
extra appliances/sensor/Corporal:832T/state (ACTIVE)

step train passing: the rear clears 829T1, then 827T1
send simulation/sensor/Corporal:829T1 (SHUNT)
extra appliances/sensor/Corporal:829T1/state (ACTIVE)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) 827T1K (829T1K)
send simulation/sensor/Corporal:827T1 (SHUNT)
extra appliances/sensor/Corporal:827T1/state (ACTIVE)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)

step lock 827: the crew at the Beet Loader presses and holds the release request
send simulation/control/Corporal:lock:827 BTN1
expect appliances/control/Corporal:lock:827/event BTN1
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) 827WLQK (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)

step lock 827: the dispatcher sees 827WLQK and sends 827WLS
send codeline/Corporal/controls CHART 85973c19 (829NWS) (829RWS) 827WLS (828WGS) (828EGS) (828HS) (830WGS) (830EGS) (830HS) (1MCS)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) 827WLK 827WLQK (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
expect appliances/control/Corporal:lock:827/cmd LAMP1

step lock 827: the crew lets go of the button and opens the lock
send simulation/control/Corporal:lock:827 (BTN1)
expect appliances/control/Corporal:lock:827/event (BTN1)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) 827WLK (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
send simulation/control/Corporal:lock:827 SW1
expect appliances/control/Corporal:lock:827/state SW1

step lock 827: the crew lines the siding by hand and pulls out westward over 827D and 827
send simulation/turnout/Corporal:827D REVERSE
extra appliances/turnout/Corporal:827D/state (NORMAL) REVERSE
send simulation/turnout/Corporal:827 REVERSE
extra appliances/turnout/Corporal:827/state (NORMAL) REVERSE
send simulation/sensor/Corporal:827T1 SHUNT
extra appliances/sensor/Corporal:827T1/state ACTIVE
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) 827WLK (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) 827T1K (829T1K)
send simulation/sensor/Corporal:827T1 (SHUNT)
extra appliances/sensor/Corporal:827T1/state (ACTIVE)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) 827WLK (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)

step lock 827: the crew restores 827 and 827D and closes the lock
send simulation/turnout/Corporal:827 NORMAL
extra appliances/turnout/Corporal:827/state NORMAL (REVERSE)
send simulation/turnout/Corporal:827D NORMAL
extra appliances/turnout/Corporal:827D/state NORMAL (REVERSE)
send simulation/control/Corporal:lock:827 (SW1)
expect appliances/control/Corporal:lock:827/state (SW1)

step lock 827: the dispatcher locks 827 again (827WLS dropped)
send codeline/Corporal/controls CHART 85973c19 (829NWS) (829RWS) (827WLS) (828WGS) (828EGS) (828HS) (830WGS) (830EGS) (830HS) (1MCS)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) 827WLK (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
extra appliances/control/Corporal:lock:827/cmd (LAMP1)
step lock 827: proven locked once the lamp has been out for the engine's withdrawal time
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
quiet 1000

# Walkthrough step 2, causally: each check, failed on its own, refuses the same CODE (830WAB
# westward, as at step 1, 829 already normal), and nothing is commanded, then or once the
# cause is gone. Every appliance command is watched, so any command here fails the run.
step 2, refused: 827D found reversed (830WAB needs it normal, derailing)
send simulation/turnout/Corporal:827D REVERSE
extra appliances/turnout/Corporal:827D/state (NORMAL) REVERSE
send codeline/Corporal/controls CHART 85973c19 829NWS (829RWS) (827WLS) 828WGS (828EGS) (828HS) 830WGS (830EGS) (830HS) (1MCS)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
quiet 1000
send simulation/turnout/Corporal:827D NORMAL
extra appliances/turnout/Corporal:827D/state NORMAL (REVERSE)
quiet 1000

step 2, refused: 827T1 occupied (830WAB clears it)
send simulation/sensor/Corporal:827T1 SHUNT
extra appliances/sensor/Corporal:827T1/state ACTIVE
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) 827T1K (829T1K)
send codeline/Corporal/controls CHART 85973c19 829NWS (829RWS) (827WLS) 828WGS (828EGS) (828HS) 830WGS (830EGS) (830HS) (1MCS)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) 827T1K (829T1K)
quiet 1000
send simulation/sensor/Corporal:827T1 (SHUNT)
extra appliances/sensor/Corporal:827T1/state (ACTIVE)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
quiet 1000

step 2, refused: 829T1 occupied (the OS of 829, which 830WAB clears)
send simulation/sensor/Corporal:829T1 SHUNT
extra appliances/sensor/Corporal:829T1/state ACTIVE
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) 829T1K
send codeline/Corporal/controls CHART 85973c19 829NWS (829RWS) (827WLS) 828WGS (828EGS) (828HS) 830WGS (830EGS) (830HS) (1MCS)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) 829T1K
quiet 1000
send simulation/sensor/Corporal:829T1 (SHUNT)
extra appliances/sensor/Corporal:829T1/state (ACTIVE)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
quiet 1000

step 2, refused: lock 827 open (the crew has the switch)
send simulation/control/Corporal:lock:827 SW1
extra appliances/control/Corporal:lock:827/state SW1
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) 827WLK (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
send codeline/Corporal/controls CHART 85973c19 829NWS (829RWS) (827WLS) 828WGS (828EGS) (828HS) 830WGS (830EGS) (830HS) (1MCS)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) 827WLK (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
quiet 1000
send simulation/control/Corporal:lock:827 (SW1)
extra appliances/control/Corporal:lock:827/state (SW1)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
quiet 1000

step 2, refused: opposing mast 828EA not proven at STOP (it has lost power: its /state reads UNAVAILABLE)
send simulation/signalmast/Corporal:828EA (POWER)
extra appliances/signalmast/Corporal:828EA/state UNAVAILABLE
send codeline/Corporal/controls CHART 85973c19 829NWS (829RWS) (827WLS) 828WGS (828EGS) (828HS) 830WGS (830EGS) (830HS) (1MCS)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
quiet 1000
send simulation/signalmast/Corporal:828EA POWER
extra appliances/signalmast/Corporal:828EA/state STOP
extra appliances/signalmast/Corporal:828EA/cmd STOP
# The mast answers the STOP it was told again: only this report proves it at STOP.
extra appliances/signalmast/Corporal:828EA/state STOP
quiet 1000

step approach locking, causally: with 832T vacant, a cancel releases at once (no time locking)
send codeline/Corporal/controls CHART 85973c19 829NWS (829RWS) (827WLS) 828WGS (828EGS) (828HS) 830WGS (830EGS) (830HS) (1MCS)
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
expect appliances/signalmast/Corporal:830WAB/cmd APPROACH
expect appliances/signalmast/Corporal:830WAB/state APPROACH
expect codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) 828WGK (828EGK) (828TEK) 830WGK (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
send codeline/Corporal/controls CHART 85973c19 829NWS (829RWS) (827WLS) (828WGS) (828EGS) 828HS (830WGS) (830EGS) 830HS (1MCS)
# The Walkthrough describes this republish ("still showing 828WGK / 830WGK until the mast
# leaves proceed") without spelling the frame; this is that frame.
expect codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) 828WGK (828EGK) (828TEK) 830WGK (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
expect appliances/signalmast/Corporal:830WAB/cmd STOP
expect appliances/signalmast/Corporal:830WAB/state STOP
extra codeline/Corporal/indications CHART 85973c19 829NWK (829RWK) (827WLK) (827WLQK) (828WGK) (828EGK) (828TEK) (830WGK) (830EGK) (830TEK) (1MCK) (827T1K) (829T1K)
quiet 1000
